/// qualification caller" stage pact.
/// Source: distribution/qualify.py
/// symbol "distribution native
/// qualification caller" (L67-137): pinned
/// CLI plus staged layout plus hash
/// gates.
/// Disposition: rewire (this row owns the
/// caller pact as reviewable Can
/// facts; old python call stays until
/// integrator rewires it after each linked
/// row, variant, plus gate has accepted
/// proof).
/// Protects (this file): the four CLI flags
/// (L69-73) plus staged dirs plus suite
/// members plus deny PATH plus hash keys
/// plus tallies that bound staging.
/// ADAPTATION (noted, plus source lines):
/// flag pins hold CLI spellings; path pins
/// hold staged bytes; key pins hold dict
/// spellings; count pins hold ints tallied
/// from L69-73 plus L119-137.
/// archive-flag pins --archive (L69);
/// report-flag pins --report (L70);
/// target-flag pins --target-file (L71);
/// isolation-flag pins --network-isolation
/// (L73 plus L103 plus L150);
/// target-default pins
/// distribution/target.json (L71 plus L127);
/// temp-prefix pins can-qualification-
/// (L119); temp-fn pins TemporaryDirectory
/// (L119); staged-dist pins distribution
/// (L126); staged-suite pins
/// tests/conformance (L128 plus L131);
/// staged-home pins home (L132);
/// staged-cwd pins unrelated-cwd (L134);
/// suite-member-a pins native.ts (L130 plus
/// L152); suite-member-b pins native.test.ts
/// (L130 plus L151); path-deny pins
/// /nonexistent (L137); sha-key pins sha256
/// (L15 plus L113 plus L117); member-key
/// pins member (L116); size-key pins size
/// (L113 plus L114); cli-flag-count pins
/// int (4) from L69-73; staged-copy-count
/// pins int (2) from L130; env-key-count
/// pins int (3) from L137.
/// Facet map (CLI then layout order):
/// archive-flag, report-flag,
/// target-flag, isolation-flag,
/// target-default, temp-prefix, temp-fn,
/// staged-dist, staged-suite, staged-home,
/// staged-cwd, suite-member-a,
/// suite-member-b, path-deny, sha-key,
/// member-key, size-key, cli-flag-count,
/// staged-copy-count, env-key-count.
/// The isolation roots live in
/// history-143-roots-green.can; the run
/// shape plus verdict live in
/// history-143-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: darwin sandbox plus linux
/// unshare or caller isolation (row lists
/// two variants; this file pins shared
/// staging; variant pins live in roots).
/// Environment: pinned upstream archive
/// plus distribution/target.json (row lists
/// two gates; bind at QN1; no live run now).
/// Logical gates SUITE/N1/ENV/ARCHIVE bind
/// at P23/QN1; no live run now.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline default
/// bound (no bun timeout in this row; binds
/// at P23 like the M31 no-run rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (P23/QN1
/// accept gates unmet).
/// Intended consumed report: M35
/// HISTORY-127..131 parsed slices (no
/// qualified report yet; P23/QN1 unmet).
/// Rewire stays blocked; qualify.py
